        - FR
        values:
        - Hotu is shocked by my success. He has created a course that he says is
          impossible to pass...
        - "Hotu est trop choqu\xE9 que je r\xE9ussise tous ses d\xE9fis. Il a cr\xE9e
          un parcours impossible \xE0 r\xE9ussir d'apr\xE8s lui..."
